@KadreeBank.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5078

# Datos sembrados en Data/seedData.json (cliente 1: Laura Gómez, documento 1012345678, PIN 1234, cuenta 1).

### Login
POST {{KadreeBank.API_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentNumber": "1012345678",
  "pin": "1234"
}

### Crear cliente (cambiar el documento para repetir)
POST {{KadreeBank.API_HostAddress}}/api/Customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentNumber": "1020304050",
  "fullName": "Sofía Ramírez",
  "type": "NaturalPerson",
  "pin": "4321"
}

### Obtener cliente con sus cuentas
GET {{KadreeBank.API_HostAddress}}/api/Customers/1

### Abrir cuenta
POST {{KadreeBank.API_HostAddress}}/api/Accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 6,
  "type": "Savings",
  "city": "Pereira"
}

### Obtener cuenta
GET {{KadreeBank.API_HostAddress}}/api/Accounts/1

### Consultar saldo
GET {{KadreeBank.API_HostAddress}}/api/Accounts/1/balance

### Consignar
POST {{KadreeBank.API_HostAddress}}/api/Accounts/1/deposits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 250000,
  "city": "Bogota"
}

### Retirar
POST {{KadreeBank.API_HostAddress}}/api/Accounts/1/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 100000,
  "city": "Bogota"
}

### Movimientos recientes
GET {{KadreeBank.API_HostAddress}}/api/Accounts/1/transactions?take=5

### Extracto mensual
GET {{KadreeBank.API_HostAddress}}/api/Accounts/1/statements/2026/9

### Reporte: clientes por número de transacciones en un mes
GET {{KadreeBank.API_HostAddress}}/api/Reports/monthly-transactions?year=2026&month=10

### Reporte: retiros fuera de la ciudad mayores a $1.000.000
GET {{KadreeBank.API_HostAddress}}/api/Reports/out-of-city-withdrawals

###
